{"sba-keyaki-16330":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんわん🐶⭐︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 今日も一日お疲れ様です😌💚\n \n \n \n 久々にねると2人ショット。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMA40CA1938YTT29N8YXWA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 髪切ったねるも可愛い♩\n 今日、たまたま長崎県産のトマトを食べたのですが美味しすぎてビックリ!しました。\n \n それをねるに話したら喜んでくれた✩\n 地元の産物を褒められるって嬉しいよね〜!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 7thシングルの個別握手会応募して下さった皆さん、ありがとうございます!🌟\n 7thこそは、24部全て完売目指していきたいです!!\n \n 今回は、9/15の幕張メッセ以外は2.3.4.5部なのでちょっとゆっくりめのスタートです😌💓\n 寝坊の心配はないよ〜〜笑😉\n \n 7th個握はなに着よう🤨!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 石森虹花🌈🌼\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYMA4ZPSB2SN94QCKJS2SBQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n ねるーねるらーねるれすと💓"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7523":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やぁみんな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ、最終オーディションの時\nぼくの顔を見たかね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰やこいつってツッコんだ自分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回転寿司に行った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行った時間が遅くて座った席が\nちょうどカーブのところで\n寿司が回ってこなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんの案内が間違ってたみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきな炙りサーモンがなかった泣\nくぅっそー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで他の握手会って\n行った事あるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全くないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の乃木メンのブログに\nコメントしたことある??"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雷とか大丈夫なほう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前雷なってて、\nとなりにいた生駒がしがみついてきて\nかわいいなぁって思ってた‼\nんー私はそんな怖がらないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート(ワンピ以外で)より、\nパンツルックの方が多い印象が\nあるんだけど、実際は\nどっちのほうが持ってるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートよりワンピ派！\nパンツスタイルもすきだよ。\nデニムがいっぱいあるかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリ撮ったりするー？\nよく取るプリ機とか\n好きなプリ機あるー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は撮らないなぁ。\n機種は詳しくない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮るとしてもそんなに盛らない\nナチュラルなのえらんでるかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼくのおねーちゃんに\nなってくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まり姉ですね←ぇ\n頼れるねーちゃんになれるように\n頑張るぜ！！もりもり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元、原宿、渋谷、乃木坂\n（←場所の名前ね）どこが1番好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃ乃木坂でしょーよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ばんざい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古着だけじゃなくて\nハイブランドわかるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこまで詳しくないかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳にピアスしよーと思うんだけど\nまりちゃそはピアスしてるのと、\nしてないのどっちがいいと、思う？\nあと、するなら\n何個ぐらいがいいと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちでも良いと思います！\n偶数より奇数の方が良いって\n聞いたことある。\n私は開けないだろうな。\nイヤリングでがまん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャグ漫画日和を見たことある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔漫画読んだことある！\nでも今は内容覚えてない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身長が小さい男の子は\nどう思いますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに何って思いません‼\n自分はあと2㎝くらい伸びたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香水おそろいにしても\nいいカナ(´ー｀)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーおそろっちイイね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンビニに入ったら\nまず何処に行きますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッション誌のとこと\nパックのジュースのところと\nヨーグルトのところ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画館にも行ったりするのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で行ったことあるよ♪\n映画館のにおいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に合ってる色って\n何色だと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔がうすいから、逆に\nはっきりした色の方がいいのかな...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月1日はママの誕生日。\nいつまでもおしゃれなママで\nいてください＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の写真は浪漫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/0506157/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-16562":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばんです！\n鈴木絢音です\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日\nお友達とお友達のママ\n私とお母さんで\n食事に出かけました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピザやパスタを\nお腹い～っぱい食べました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また女子会したいな～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先週...\n初釜に出席させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は着物で\n新年のお茶をいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心落ち着くひととき..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から2月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月3日は節分\n今年の恵方は「東北東」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無病息災を祈って\n恵方巻をガブリッと食べる予定です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家は\n「福は内、鬼は外」と落花生を撒いて\n年齢（数え年）の数だけ豆を食べて\n厄除けを行いますが、\n福豆（炒り大豆）を撒く地方も\nあるようですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは落花生？福豆？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい子にしてないと\n絢音なまはげが来ますよ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月7日は\nお母さんのお誕生日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2014/02/01/5782943/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「感謝の気持ちを忘れないでね」が口癖のお母さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から\n色々な事にチャレンジさせてくれ\n応援してくれるお母さん\n感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかきっと親孝行します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月11日は\n握手会(幕張会場)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけて会場に来て下さいね！\n絢音待ってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月14日は\nバレンタインデー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作りチョコをお父さんに\nプレゼントする予定です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-