":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなもそう~？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲ライブで聞けたらきっと泣いちゃうな\nそんな曲に出会った時それを自分も普段から届けられてたらな~って気持ちが着いてきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せだな~って。  思ってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mobQi9q9l.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mob6LI6pL.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mobWu3Ahm.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもわかりやすい 最近の好き です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mobc32304.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして  1月22日 に誕生日を迎えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳 、 になりました~~ ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくり。もう20歳、まだ20歳か~\nどっちもしっくりくるけれど 今までの誕生日の中でも1番大きく変化がありそうな歳なので、ちょっぴり楽しみにしていました、 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢とともに 好き も変化していくとは思うけど、変わらず自分らしくいれますように。\n⤴︎ これは皆さんも！ ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mobzzMj9N.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、 明日  20時~\nSHOWROOM配信をしようと思ってます 🍀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日過ぎちゃったけどバースデーって事なので\n是非遊びに来てくださると嬉しいです …"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202501/mobCuKpVj.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳の山下 瞳月 もよろしくお願いします。"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-59878":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎧散歩道/JUDY AND MARYさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様、お疲れ様です。\n兵庫県出身 20歳\nひらほーのワカメちゃん\n小西夏菜実です🐺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばさ、歩いてたら舞台「サザエさん」のポスターを見かけたの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひらほーに報告したくてすぐさま写真を撮ろうとスマホのカメラ開いたら\"容量がなくて撮れません\"って表示されちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっ！絶対撮りたい！と、カバンの中に隠し持っていたデジカメで撮影に成功✌︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどスマホにその写真移し替えてないからひらほーに報告してないままです。ま、いっか。\nいつの間にか報告より撮るのが目的になってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台応援してるよ〜^^ 絶対観に行きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【日向坂ちゃんねる】\nYouTubeの「日向坂ちゃんねる」にて\n小西夏菜実・清水理央・宮地すみれで\n伊香保温泉へ行ってまいりました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台の休演日に\n人生初の玉こんにゃく食べたり、卓球したり、温泉入ったり、美味しいご飯食べながら爆語りしたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉は音声だけダヨ🫣♨️(韻踏んでる？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後、多分みんなが思ってる10倍は日向坂の活動について語ってるから見てほしいな〜💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人の私服も色味が合ってて可愛いの！\n春っぽいよね🌸そこも注目です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⭐️ここで私の推しポイント紹介⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2分56秒▶︎舞台「五等分の花嫁」序盤三玖と風太郎のシーン再現。宮地すみれの姿で見れるのはレアです！！りお太郎もありがとう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3分39秒▶︎唐突なスクショタイム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4分03秒▶︎これはクオッカの鳴き声ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4分29秒▶︎ひと口でいったすみかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5分17秒▶︎早食い小西"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6分10秒▶︎かわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6分54秒▶︎触れない小西"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8分42秒▶︎参加できました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8分54秒▶︎急に始まる卓球大会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11分19秒▶︎打ち返す気ないやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12分41秒▶︎これほんまに何なん笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14分49秒▶︎三者三様！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15分34秒▶︎モスキートーン笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17分24分▶︎爆語りブロック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見て一緒にのんびりしてくださーーい☺️\n⬇️\nhttps://youtu.be/Q5xPsMDY2H0"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobyXcArP.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobAwzgef.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/moboiXJjS.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/moba6X0wG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobLwqlyo.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mob6oqOWO.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobLU0JqJ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobCBnOeV.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルラズフロント〜🫐\n3人の名前ほしいなあ。いつか決めよっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ひなた坂46ライブ】\nついに明日、ひなた坂ライブ本番です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のチケットはまだゲットできます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の公演でね、すっごくみんなに見てほしい曲があるんだ。\n配信がないから現地でしか見れないんだけど😭だからできるだけ来てほしいなぁ🥺\nずっと歌ってみたかった曲だから楽しみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日通しリハやったけど楽しすぎて一瞬だったし、とっても盛りあがるかっこいいセトリです‼️\nとにかく会場で一緒に盛り上がりたいので\n待ってます😻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チケットはこちらから⬇️\nhttps://l-tike.com/order/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobajacpa.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【近況トーーク！】\nよーこのブログを読んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに、言葉って重いなって改めて思った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段あまり意識してないけど、人から受け取る言葉ひとつひとつをちゃんと噛んで飲み込んでみたら色んな見え方が変わるかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その言葉をくれた相手はどんなことを思って、どれくらいの熱量で自分に伝えてくれたのか\n正解は本人に聞かないと分からないけど、考えないよりずっとマシなのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、大切な人であればあるほど渡す言葉を考えてしまいます。\n頭の回転が遅めなので、考えて、考えすぎて何が正解か分からなくなって、でも嘘はつきたくなくて\n結局何も言わなかったり、自分的不正解を渡してしまうこともしばしば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ言ってこう思われたらどうしよう とか 傷つけちゃうかもしれない とか\nなんかほんとに考えすぎなんですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもそんなに考えておいて\"ああ言えばよかった\"が後から出てくるからどうしようもないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「自分が傷つきたくない」が先行しちゃってるのかな〜\n全ては頭の回転が早ければ...( -᷅_-᷄ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず、自分の言葉に自信が持てるように本とかいっぱい読んでみようかな。ひなた坂ライブ終わったら！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと久しぶりにゲームセンターにりなと行ってみたの\nそしたら三玖と一花のフィギュアUFOキャッチャーが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運命感じたから、2人とも頑張ってゲットしたよん♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobwqtxdG.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202504/mobrL62zJ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなまた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#nanamiblog"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-n46-101897":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.p1 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 14.0px '.AppleSystemUIFont'; min-height: 21.1px}\np.p2 {margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 14.0px '.Hiragino Kaku Gothic Interface'}\nspan.s1 {font-family: 'UICTFontTextStyleBody'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 14.00px}\nspan.s2 {font-family: '.HiraKakuInterface-W3'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 14.00px}\nspan.s3 {font-family: 'NotoSansBamum-Regular'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 14.00px}\nspan.s4 {font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 14.00px}"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかてれさまです‪𖦹‎  ̫ 𖦹‎